{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL BET \u2013 FIGHTING CASINO \u2013</strong><br>A turn-based competitive battle game that fuses <strong>strategic card combat</strong> with <strong>high-stakes chip betting</strong>\u2014a <strong>Gambling \u00d7 Fighting Card Battle</strong> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter an underground casino\u2019s fighting tournament as one of the casino owners. Sign contracts with elite warriors who each have their own past, build your roster, and keep winning to claim the throne of the dark casino.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1) Strategic Turn-Based Card Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a shared set of <strong>open cards</strong> to attack, defend, and unleash skills. Reduce your opponent\u2019s HP to <strong>0</strong> to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you can see what your opponent can play, every turn becomes a tense mind game\u2014full of prediction, bluffing, and calculated risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2) The BET System: Gamble for the Right to Strike</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the player who bets <strong>more chips</strong> on their card earns the <strong>right to attack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful resource management\u2014and the courage to go all-in at the perfect moment\u2014can decide the match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3) Aim for the Top in Solo Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Solo Mode, you\u2019ll sign contracts with a variety of warriors, repeat battles and preparation, and climb toward becoming the ruler of the underground casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up your warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy gambling mini-games and other side activities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2941500?t=1769257599","backgro